{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jEgPZls0lb1794446522.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國紐約布魯克林區有建築物倒塌，最少1死12傷。</p><p></p><p>事發在當地周三下午約4時，布魯克林區中部一幢三層高建築倒塌，救援人員在瓦礫堆中搜救被困的人。事發的社區主要是住宅區，居民以黑人及加勒比裔為主，倒塌的建築地下是商店，上面是住宅，旁邊的建築正進行拆卸，當局正調查倒塌與工程是否有關。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:07:17.985335+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T01:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:17:13.069619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:00:43.012139+00:00","content_hash":"da3db5af1d7c00cf617057bb66a7501869e9031bcd3027303a089052de5ec363","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:07:17.985335+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}